    "body": "I won't approve this since I still need to do my Rust reading, but I've looked through the code line-by-line.\r\n\r\nThis, or something similar to this, appears multiple times across different files. Is there a way to reduce duplication here or would that not make sense in this case?\r\n```\r\nimpl fmt::Display for Module {\r\n    fn fmt(&self, f: &mut fmt::Formatter) -> fmt::Result {\r\n        let ansi_strings = self.ansi_strings();\r\n        write!(f, \"{}\", ANSIStrings(&ansi_strings))\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```",
